description: Project-wide engineering standards for krypto2
alwaysApply: true
---

# Project

- MUST target Python 3.12 only (`requires-python = ">=3.12,<3.13"`).
- MUST pin critical dependency versions (especially Telethon); MUST NOT use floating ranges without justification.
- MUST write production-ready code; temporary workarounds require an explicit `TODO` with reason.
- MUST NOT leave dead code, unused imports, or commented-out blocks.
- MUST study existing repository abstractions before introducing new architecture.
- MUST NOT duplicate existing modules or ports.
- MUST keep this stage free of Bybit / exchange order execution logic.
